    "primary_rights_policy":"A curator CC badge alone is insufficient. Review the original UCI publication's explicit license notice and any conflicting donor notice. Broad roadmap approval does not override restrictions.",
    "pending_decisions":{
      "tabarena-46906":"Anneal: minority class size 8 fails the frozen min_total=30 margin for nested selection. No claim that all alternative Anneal protocols are impossible. Task 363614/version 18 verified; no model or relabeling.",
      "tabarena-46908":"APSFailure: primary UCI text reproduces Scania's GPL-3.0-or-later notice while its page license panel says CC BY 4.0. Resolve original-license/curation obligations explicitly before approval; do not rely on the curator badge.",
      "tabarena-46913":"Blood transfusion: primary metadata describes RFM history and March 2007 donation labels but does not explicitly establish the feature-history extraction cutoff. Do not invent a pre-March boundary or claim prospective prediction. Duplicates are documented, not automatically deleted.",
      "tabarena-46952":"QSAR biodegradation: metadata rights/schema inspected, but possible chemical-origin overlap with selected QSAR fish toxicity is unresolved. Keep separate provisional identity; neither assert they are the same family nor count both as independent confirmation.",
      "tabarena-46956":"Seismic bumps: original source is next-shift forecasting across coal-mine longwalls. Published shuffled official task does not establish time/group separation; route to a temporal/grouped protocol rather than this IID confirmation cohort.",
      "tabarena-46960":"Student dropout: native predictors include first/second-semester grades, approvals and evaluations plus timing-ambiguous debtor/fee fields. A reviewed enrollment-time subset or explicit later cutoff is not established; no automatic target/proxy leakage.",
      "tabarena-46963":"Website phishing: primary source defines 103 Suspicious labels as either phishing or legitimate based on mixed features. Target adjudication and duplicate/domain identity are unresolved; do not pad native multiclass coverage with an ambiguous endpoint.",
      "other_pending_entries":"Curated identity and target only. Original rights, upstream identity/exposure, full prediction-time schema and split feasibility remain unreviewed; no acquisition or freshness claim."
